Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:03:44 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1057/1259] Train: a wizard for YuE2 LoRAs

1063 (Viktor): a fifth tab walks a LoRA from raw songs to loras/: a folder of
datasets/raw/ and its tracks (in or out, a style of their own, the lyrics
matched by version name and cleaned), the shared style line and a trigger
word, a set made by the lab, a kind of adapter (style, voice, language,
artist) with its defaults, the run with its progress and the AR loss (a
warning near 0: memorizing), stop, and the runs with their LoRAs. The work
is the lab's (training.py), AI-Toolkit underneath for now.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
